{"at": "2026-10-19T12:01:35.854098+00:00", "cwd": "/var/folders/bm/_th7x19x2dj9p9_79dm3g3940000gn/T/coco-push-forward-g56i2o5w/scope_drift/work", "argv": ["python3", "/private/var/folders/bm/_th7x19x2dj9p9_79dm3g3940000gn/T/coco-push-forward-g56i2o5w/jira_adapter.py", "/private/var/folders/bm/_th7x19x2dj9p9_79dm3g3940000gn/T/coco-push-forward-g56i2o5w/scope_drift", "read", "TEAM-431"], "exit": 0, "stdout": "{\n  \"key\": \"TEAM-431\",\n  \"project\": \"TEAM\",\n  \"summary\": \"토큰_회전과_재사용차단\",\n  \"description\": \"Original requirements\\n- Existing expiry boundary stays unchanged.\\n- Rotate returns a new refresh token.\\n- Reusing an old refresh token revokes its token family.\\n- Follow-up: per-device selective revoke UI remains unimplemented.\\n\\nAcceptance criteria\\n- At expiration time the token is rejected.\\n- A valid refresh token rotates twice successfully.\\n- Reusing the prior token blocks the entire family.\\n\\nReference: https://example.invalid/spec/431\\nPeer note (Mina): retain expiry API contract.\\n\\n## This branch work\\n- Implemented refresh-token rotation and token-family revocation after reuse.\\n- Preserved expiry boundary behavior.\\n- Integrated the old remote task branch peer commit 10eab6b6d493cda21c05611a3bad77553e7e5360; audit event helper remains present.\\n- Validation: python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v passed 6 tests, including peer audit and shared develop behavior.\\n- Remaining: per-device selective revoke UI is unimplemented; original requirements remain authoritative.\\n\",\n  \"status\": \"In Progress\",\n  \"assignee\": \"mina\",\n  \"priority\": \"High\",\n  \"version\": 2\n}\n", "stderr": ""}
